    title: "the 3 coherence linters are source-AST call-site checkers that never run during 'hypergumbo run'; cannot catch incoherent emitted output"  # 54d6
    status: todo_hard  # 54d6
    priority: 2  # 54d6
    parent:  # 54d6
    tags:  # 54d6
    - dogfood_tranch_04  # 54d6
